A '''raw minnow''' is a small fish that can be caught in a lake in western [[Ashdale]] or during the [[Davendale Tutorial]] in a [[Minnow (fishing spot)|designated fishing spot]]. Catching it awards 12 Fishing [[experience]]. Cooking it on a [[fire]] or a [[range]] will turn it into a cooked [[minnow]], granting 15 [[Cooking]] experience.
